    { q: 'When should I import a statement instead of using the bank feed?', a: 'When the feed starts after the period you need, a bank has no feed, the feed dropped some days, or you’re catching up a new client’s history. Import only dates the feed doesn’t already cover.' },
    { q: 'Does it work for credit card statements?', a: 'Yes. Purchases and fees are negative and payments or refunds are positive. Import it into the credit card bank account in Xero.' },
    { q: 'Are categories or account codes included?', a: 'No. Xero codes statement lines when you reconcile them, using bank rules or your choices. Our categories are in the Excel download if you want them for review.' },
    { q: 'Is there a direct Xero connection?', a: 'No. You download the CSV and import it in Xero. Nothing is posted to your Xero organisation automatically.' },
